<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/ExpandedLicensing/License> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A License represents a license text, whether listed on the\nSPDX License List <https://spdx.org/licenses/>\n(ListedLicense) or defined by an SPDX data creator (CustomLicense)."@en .
